  {
   "key": "editor_note",
   "label": "Catatan editor",
   "default": "Today is not only about celebrating a birthday, but also about celebrating the person you have become through every challenge, every achievement, every lesson, and every little moment in between. Looking back, this year has been filled with growth, laughter, unexpected adventures, and countless memories that have shaped your story."
  },
  {
   "key": "girl_body",
   "label": "Cerita Who's That Girl",
   "default": "She’s the reason this special edition exists—a girl filled with kindness, laughter, and unforgettable memories. Today, we’re celebrating her story, her journey, and everything that makes her unique. From the little moments that often go unnoticed to the milestones that deserve to be remembered forever, every chapter of her life tells a story worth sharing."
  },
