   "key": "letter_title",
   "label": "Judul surat",
   "default": "A Letter to Keelya"
  },
  {
   "key": "letter_body",
   "label": "Isi surat",
   "default": "Dear Friends,\n\nIf there’s one thing I’ll always be grateful for, it’s having people like you in my life. Thank you for the laughter, the endless conversations, the spontaneous adventures, and all the memories we’ve created together. Some of my favorite moments wouldn’t be the same without you.\n\nThank you for being there during both the good days and the difficult ones. For listening when I needed someone to talk to, celebrating my achievements as if they were your own, and reminding me that I’m never alone. Your kindness, support, and friendship have meant more to me than words can fully express.\n\nLife changes, people grow, and paths may lead us in different directions, but I hope we always carry these memories with us. No matter where we are or how much time passes, I’ll always look back on our friendship with a smile.\n\nThank you for being part of my story. I truly appreciate every moment, every laugh, and every memory we’ve shared. Here’s to all the memories behind us and all the ones still waiting to be made."
  },
  {
   "key": "letter_close",
   "label": "Salam penutup",
   "default": "With love, always."
